### Actual behavior

I am using the Ingestion Pipeline in RAGFlow to add custom metadata extraction. I configured a Transformer component with the Metadata generation type (see Figure 2 for the specific settings) and placed it in the pipeline flow (see Figure 1). After running the pipeline, the custom metadata is never added to the final chunks or documents, even though the logs clearly show that the extraction logic ran successfully and produced the expected metadata values.

