### Expected behavior

The metadata extracted by the Transformer (Metadata type) should be stored in the chunk-level or document-level metadata and be visible/usable in retrieval (e.g., for filtering, display in results, or downstream nodes).



### Steps to reproduce

```Markdown
Created/edited an Ingestion Pipeline.
Added a Transformer node configured for Metadata generation (with custom prompt/rules for extraction).
Connected it properly in the pipeline after the Parser/Chunker.
Uploaded or re-parsed documents using this pipeline.
```

